msgstr "向屏幕阅读器发送无障碍功能信息的试验功能。"

#: src/org.gnome.Ptyxis.gschema.xml.in:260
msgid "Enable zoom on scroll holding the control key"
msgstr "启用按住 Ctrl 键滚动缩放"

#: src/org.gnome.Ptyxis.gschema.xml.in:261
msgid ""
"Enable to adjust the zoom level on scroll scroll while holding the control "
